    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "CHINA AIRWAYS FEDERAL INC. U. S. A.\n3 CANTON ROAD\nSHANGHAI\nNORTH AMERICAN AVIATION, INC.\nINTERCONTINENT AVIATION, INC.\nCURTISS-WRIGHT CORPORATION\nCURTISS AEROPLANE AND MOTOR COMPANY\nWRIGHT AERONAUTICAL CORPORATION\nCURTISS-WRIGHT AIRPLANE COMPANY\nDOUGLAS AIRCRAFT COMPANY\nSPERRY GYROSCOPE COMPANY\nThese mandarin coats are perhaps 75 or 80 years old.\nThe Peking stitch on them, like little french knots,\nis no longer being done.\nThese coats were worn only\nby the mandarins.\nThe lining in them is new but they\nare slightly soiled around the neck.\nThey have been\ncleaned but they are so old these stains will not\ncome out.\nThe white material for drapes, 18 yards, is artificial\nsilk and looks better after dyed.\nTakes a dye beauti-\nfully, not quite so shiny - any color. Hangs best with\n\u0026 cotton lining.\n6/23\nDeariat Debs-\nJust rushing this letter\nn.4. on the Coolays\nMin Forks bought two mandarm\nCoats which the got through a\ndealer in Feiping, and also she\nbought the mature which\nthought you might be able to\nuss in\nthe cottage - the cont\ncort 28°0 and 38s0 tags left on\nThe matrial cort 15c mex.",
